          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "岩屑岩性识别业务问题",
          "html": "<p>每 1—2 m 捞样一次，单井数百个样品；岩屑细小、混样严重，同一块样品不同人描述可差一个粒级，含油级别判定更依赖经验。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"异组样品特征分布\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" fill=\"#274746\"><path d=\"M112 258H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.02</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"112\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.0</text><path d=\"M112 205.5H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"210.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.23</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"251.5\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.3</text><path d=\"M112 153H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.45</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"391\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.5</text><path d=\"M112 100.5H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"105.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.66</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"530.5\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">0.7</text><path d=\"M112 48H670\" stroke=\"#d6e4e2\"/><text class=\"plot-y-tick\" x=\"100\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"15\">0.87</text><text class=\"plot-x-tick\" x=\"670\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\">1.0</text><circle cx=\"444.27\" cy=\"74.27\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"510.40\" cy=\"95.45\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"482.75\" cy=\"48.00\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"566.62\" cy=\"97.22\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"474.83\" cy=\"72.13\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"494.12\" cy=\"86.91\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"472.62\" cy=\"70.02\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"479.84\" cy=\"74.72\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#087f76\"/><circle cx=\"479.42\" c